{'symbol': 'ZION', 'date': '2021-08-26 17:03:00', 'title': "ZIONS BANCORPORATION'S BOARD APPROVES ADDITIONAL $200 MILLION OF SHARE REPURCHASE FOR THIRD QUARTER 2021", 'text': "SALT LAKE CITY--(BUSINESS WIRE)--ZIONS BANCORPORATION, N.A. (NASDAQ: ZION) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS (“BOARD”) AUTHORIZED AN ADDITIONAL COMMON SHARE REPURCHASE FOR THE THIRD QUARTER OF 2021 OF UP TO $200 MILLION. THE BOARD HAD PREVIOUSLY AUTHORIZED $125 MILLION FOR THE THIRD QUARTER; WITH TODAY'S AUTHORIZATION, THE AMOUNT AUTHORIZED IS NOW UP TO $325 MILLION, OR APPROXIMATELY 3.5% OF THE COMPANY'S CURRENT MARKET CAPITALIZATION. AS OF AUGUST 24, 2021, ZIONS HAD REPURCHASED $98"}